() Tj T*
(SCOPE OF WORK) Tj T*
(This specification covers supply and installation of borewell submersible) Tj T*
(pumpsets and water quality testing complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — BOREWELL SUBMERSIBLE PUMPSETS) Tj T*
(\(a\) Submersible pumpsets shall be manufactured to IS 8034:2018.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Duty point of each pumpset shall be 18 m3/hr at 90 mtrs total head.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Overall pumpset efficiency at duty point shall be minimum 52%.) Tj T*
(\(d\) The submersible motor shall be of rewindable wet type as per IS 9283:2013.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Flat submersible cables of 3 core 6 sq mm copper, PVC insulated, shall) Tj T*
(comply with IS 694:2010 and be tested to IS 10810.) Tj T*
(\(f\) The starter panel shall include dry run protection, overload relay and) Tj T*
(single phasing preventer.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — TREATED WATER QUALITY) Tj T*
(\(a\) The quality of water supplied shall meet IS 10500:2012.) Tj T*
(\(b\) pH value: 6.5 to 8.5) Tj T*
(\(c\) TDS of supplied water shall be within 500 ppm. Turbidity of treated water) Tj T*
(shall be limited to 5 N.T.U..) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
