(\(d\) Fluoride content shall be within 1.0 ppm. Nitrate as NO3 shall be less than) Tj T*
(45 ppm.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Arsenic content in supplied water shall be less than 0.01 ppm.) Tj T*
(\(f\) Total hardness shall be within 200 ppm as CaCO3.) Tj T*
(\(g\) Total coliforms shall be absent in any 100 ml sample.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 5: TESTING, INSPECTION AND CERTIFICATION) Tj T*
(\(a\) Physico-chemical tests shall follow IS 3025 and bacteriological examination) Tj T*
(shall follow IS 1622. Pre-dispatch inspection shall be offered to the) Tj T*
(Department's authorised representative with 15 days notice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6 DOCUMENTATION, WARRANTY AND TRAINING) Tj T*
(\(a\) Monthly water quality reports shall be furnished to the Department.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Shop drawings and schematic diagrams shall be got approved from the) Tj T*
(Engineer-in-charge before manufacture.) Tj T*
(\(c\) O&M manuals, as-built drawings and catalogues shall be furnished in) Tj T*
(triplicate at the time of handing over.) Tj T*
(\(d\) The supplier shall replace free of cost any part found defective within the) Tj T*
(defect liability period of 24 months.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Training of two operators for one week shall be imparted by the supplier) Tj T*
(after commissioning.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
